+
+Personal exercise, 2026-09-15. This is an attack map and assumption ledger,
+not an audit or a theorem about the minimal axioms. The exercise skill is
+read at current main 5aca149c42debb7b0adaa2e9d1a374af4c5d4b78; its bytes
+match the installed source. Execution remains personal without subagents.
